{"id":"n16477-1-4","stage":3,"title":"싸구려 · 便宜货","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16477-1-4-1","ko":"이 화장품 좋아 보인다. 얼마 주고 샀어?","zh":"这款化妆品看起来不错啊。你花多少钱买的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"화장품","meaning":"化妆品","explanation":"화장품：化妆品","readings":[{"term":"화장품","audio":"/audio/740b80a0f4f8ee4087dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73232","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화장품","audio":"/audio/740b80a0f4f8ee4087dd.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}},{"text":"보인다.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보인다","audio":"/audio/c5599ca51192f3bb6c59.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}},{"text":"주고","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주고","audio":"/audio/c510b47c8539f2fdcb5a.mp3"}},{"text":"샀어?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀어","audio":"/audio/99447433ba1c04adef5e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"740b80a0f4f8ee40","term":"화장품","zh":"化妆品","audio":"/audio/740b80a0f4f8ee4087dd.mp3","entryId":"73232","definition":"为了美观或护理皮肤而涂抹在脸上的物品。","pronunciation":["화장품"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/368372a78575b422cc40.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16477-1-4-2","ko":"응, 싼값에 산 싸구려이지만 품질은 좋더라.","zh":"嗯，虽然只是花低价买来的便宜货，但质量挺好的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"싼값에","meaning":"便宜，贱；价格，价钱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；값：价格，价钱；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"},{"term":"값","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"20178","senseId":"1","lemma":"값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싼값에","audio":"/audio/e7e7a04de6a6674c532b.mp3"}},{"text":"산","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}},{"text":"싸구려이지만","meaning":"便宜货，廉价货","explanation":"싸구려：便宜货，廉价货；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"싸구려","audio":"/audio/dcae53701dd6e2b8607e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16477","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸구려","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸구려이지만","audio":"/audio/84900970342de6323d4a.mp3"}},{"text":"품질은","meaning":"品质，质量","explanation":"품질：品质，质量；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"품질","audio":"/audio/ce22e94483cb4fbf1920.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88645","senseId":"1","lemma":"품질","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"품질은","audio":"/audio/7928c0f7fcebcc668e0e.mp3"}},{"text":"좋더라.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋더라","audio":"/audio/0663ec318c0a23082769.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01